  quantumProcessingExamples_message227: "Split the QPU plugin into capability plugins\n\nThe QPU was one hand-composed plugin; the generated module now defines\nqpu-core, qpu-agents and qpu-machine with definePlugin.\n# a comment git strips\n",
  quantumProcessingExamples_message229: "A page always has a route and the static build reads every page: generateStaticParams falls back from the breadcrumb URL to the slug and then to the page's UUID\n",
