  quantumProcessingExamples_text132: "source: https://github.com/zenodo/zenodo-rdm\ntitle: Coil\n\nA coil is one sealed UUID.\nidea: The seal holds.\n  idea: The address is the coin.\nidea: The seal holds.\n",
