  quantumProcessingIdeas_statement84: "The downloads page offers the Proxmox Backup Server 4.2 ISO installer, version 4.2-1, 1.48 GB, updated April 29, 2026, SHA256 2fb299deac3929253712c9c3dfc9237edbe70af83c8848467616b771a1d5453e, and a torrent. The file is not downloaded here.\nidea: A torrent is offered for this installer.",
