  quantumProcessingTextbookMeasured_says38: "decodeE2e with the tree as a copy, its answer recomputed by the handler (tree): the voters are the tree and every host not erased; a majority of them decides, every voter off the majority — the tree among them — is a flip, and the flips and the erasures are the syndrome; a 304 echoing a hash other than the tree's recomputed one is no involution",
