  quantumProcessingToolboxesCrypto_by3: "integer comparisons: the byte count against the bound, the row count against the pieces",
  quantumProcessingToolboxesCrypto_coordination99: "read answers followUps (the beacon's previous pulse by index); the client fetches them and reads again until none follow: one combination, several MCP-shaped sources, agnostic of which answered",
  quantumProcessingToolboxesCrypto_description10: "qubit exchange over an address: { address, hexbit? } — navigation, teleport and σ₁₅ signal; the combination space is not walked",
