  quantumProcessingToolboxesGoogle_formula27: "E_VQE(θ*) = min_θ ⟨00|exp(iθ Y⊗X) H exp(−iθ Y⊗X)|00⟩ = E_FCI = −1.137284 Ha < E_HF = −1.116759 Ha",
