  quantumProcessingToolboxesGoogle_s1: "the MCP handler has not bound call yet: import mcp.ts before the google toolbox runs",
  quantumProcessingToolboxesGoogle_s16: "amplitudes * bits = 137438953472 ∧ mint bits * bits = 137438953472",
  quantumProcessingToolboxesGoogle_s17: "⟦0⟧ handles × ⟦1⟧ qubits = ⟦2⟧. The demand ⟦3⟧ sits inside that capacity. ⟦4⟧ × ⟦5⟧ = ⟦6⟧",
  quantumProcessingToolboxesGoogle_s39: "⟦0⟧ of ⟦1⟧ Google challenge(s) teleported via hexbit + 2 gateway bits (ftl, combination space unwalked; bundle ⟦2⟧, SHA-256 ⟦3⟧)",
